# skhd — simple hotkey daemon for macOS
# Config: ~/.config/skhd/skhdrc (XDG)

# ─── Global shortcuts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ctrl+` toggles SupaCode (visor-style): raise+focus when hidden/unfocused,
# hide when already focused. Logic lives in bin/dot-local/bin/supacode-toggle,
# which drives focus via an Apple Event `activate` — `supacode open` alone can't
# steal focus from a background daemon (macOS suppresses NSApplication
# activation by non-GUI processes).
# 0x32 = kVK_ANSI_Grave (backtick/grave accent key)
ctrl - 0x32 : $HOME/.local/bin/supacode-toggle
